      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Chibani et al.",
        "AbstractText": "Here, we present the draft genome sequence of Vibrio splendidus type strain DSM 19640. V. splendidus is an abundant species among coastal vibrioplankton. The assembly resulted in a 5,729,362-bp draft genome with 5,032 protein-coding sequences, 6 rRNAs, and 117 tRNAs."
      },
